// .tree DSL — the Looter intro.  Grammar lives in tree.ts (the parser).
//
//   @root NAME                    entry node
//   == NAME                       node header (semantic name)
//   <prose…>                      what the Looter says; may contain [[ ]]
//   - "player line" -> target     an answer; target = node name | url
//   no answers                    → terminal
//
//   [[ base | question | result ]]   inline expansion
//     base      word shown in the sentence
//     question  tooltip on hover
//     result    inline text (may nest more [[ ]])  OR  -> nodeName (reuse graph)
//
//   Prose is inline markdown: _em_, *em*, [text](url) all render.
//
//   Everything recurses: results nest, results point at nodes, answers cycle.

@root start

== start
Hey, you there! You seen any outlaws around here?
- "Uh, you look like one?" -> denial
- "No, haven't seen any outlaws lately." -> no-outlaws

== denial
Preposterous! I'm a serious guy, an engineer, a lecturer.
- "Yeah, right. What is this place?" -> reveal
- "Engineer? You build roads or something?" -> roads

== no-outlaws
They're holed up in this country like rats, but we'll smoke them out yet.
- "Is this their hideout?" -> reveal

== reveal
This is an archive of [[the Looter | who?! | my edgy and opinionated alter ego]], [[a collection | of what? | of notes, rants, kitbashes and experiments, perhaps a finished game or two]].
- "Okay, so what do you actually do here?" -> pitch

== roads
Well, not like _that_. I build software. This actually isn't even my website, go read [my blog](https://haspar.us) instead.
- "Okay, so who's the Looter? What is this place?" -> reveal

== pitch
I find it interesting how systems shape the stories we tell, so I yoink a bunch of things from different games, blabber something incomprehensible about n-dimensional spaces, and make my friends play it. They keep asking for more. Weirdos!
- "I'll take a look." -> friendly
- "So why'd *you* ask me about outlaws?" -> bug
- "Surrender or die!" -> hostile

== friendly
Hope you find something worth stealing.

== hostile
You'll never take me alive!

== bug
[It happens.](https://i.imgur.com/hzKOvy8.jpeg)
